  "description": "Prior Approval Application under Part 3, Class G of the GPDO for the change of use of the first floor from existing commercial use (Office/Class E) to a mixed-use development including 1 no. high-quality self-contained 2-bedroom, 3-person residential flat (Class C3). The existing ground-floor retail unit (currently occupied by Demon Ink) will be retained in its entirety.\n\nThe proposed internal works involve the configuration of the 43.3m² Gross Internal Area (GIA) first floor into two bedrooms at the front of the property (Bedroom 1: 11.50m² and Bedroom 2: 9.50m²), an open-plan living, dining, and kitchen area at the rear (22.21m²), a family bathroom (2.87m²), a central hallway (2.50m²), and a dedicated internal storage closet (1.20m²). \n\nMinor layout modifications at the rear ground-floor level will establish a private, independent residential entrance lobby and corridor. This provides secure, unobstructed access via a dedicated internal staircase to the first-floor flat, ensuring complete physical and operational separation from the ground-floor commercial unit. No extensions or external footprint modifications are proposed.",
